<title>GERMANY: Lufthansa cuts fares on seven inland routes.</title>
<headline>Lufthansa cuts fares on seven inland routes.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>German airline Deutsche Lufthansa AG said on Monday it was immediately cutting fares on seven domestic routes.  </p>
<p>Lufthansa said it was reducing its fares on the routes Munich-Hamburg, Munich-Cologne/Bonn, Munich-Duesseldorf, Munich-Berlin, Cologne/Bonn-Berlin, Stuttgart-Berlin and Duesseldorf-Berlin to as low as 222 marks ($131).</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
<p>($ = 1.692 German Marks)</p>
